and practical disciplines like filmmaking,
cooking and art. But it can really be anything.

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:12.440
Recently I've been trying to get back into
cooking and took this awesome class by Elena

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:18.200
Carp for the second time actually, on how
to properly use kitchen knife. Or how about

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:23.420
this course on how to make sushi? The first
1000 of you foxes to click the link in the

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:29.270
description will get a 1 month free trial
of Skillshare so you can start exploring your

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.860
creativity today.

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:38.010
So the baseline is: Sanji is the most self-sacrificial
straw hat, which is really impressive given

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:51.500
how often one of the straw hats pulls one
of these moments. But while Luffy risks his

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:57.450
life for his dream and Zoro risks his for
his principles, Sanji risks his life because

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:03.301
he feels indebted to people. This behavior
is established right from the start, during

00:10:03.301 --> 00:10:08.820
the Baratie arc, where he refuses to leave
the restaurant because of his debt to Zeff,

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:24.120
despite literally being fired. And just a
bit later he is prepared to let Pearl kill

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:31.330
him for the exact same reason. When he offers
himself to the women he chases, he means it

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:35.550
quite literally. And the same of course goes
for the straw hats. He would rather be alone

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:39.910
and die rather than see his family hurt.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:57.269
Sanji was born with incredible kindness and
altruism. His role on the ship is literally

00:10:57.269 --> 00:11:02.959
taking care of the crew and making sure everyone
is healthy and happy. And he always fights

00:11:02.959 --> 00:11:06.370
for the weak.
And it's also the reason why Sanji keeps going

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:11.240
on his solo missions. He wants to be of use
to the crew and take care of things on his

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:16.740
own. Which is one of the reasons why he gets
into fights with Zoro, who fights for everyone

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:23.200
in battle, but otherwise spends his time on
the ship sleeping and training. So: Yes. kindness

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:27.750
is inarguably Sanji's most! important! trait!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:33.600
However combined with his abusive and traumatic
childhood, he is not able to extend that love

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:40.060
and care to the person that needs it the most:
himself. Someone compared that to this scene

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:53.779
from fire force, that I found incredibly fitting.

00:11:53.779 --> 00:11:57.940
And at the same time, I also believe that
Sanji's perviness and sexism, come from the

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:02.890
same good place as well. The only two people
who showed him love as a kid were his sister

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:15.880
and his mother, who were both dominated by
his father and brothers. No wonder he would

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:20.570
put a woman on a pedestal and see them as
something beautiful that needs protection

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:26.220
from men. The second half of his life he then
grew up in a family of only dudes, all of

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:33.410
them tough-guy sailors. Of course he would
get that extra portion of macho with that.

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:39.810
Sanji grew up on sea his entire life. He is
the most piratey crew member. Well except

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:48.380
Jinbe, he literally lives in the ocean. [Spongebob
intro] And don't forget that Sanji spent 2

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:54.220
years on Okama island, chased around 24/7.
That's literally the reason why Oda made him

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:58.899
go overboard with all the intolerable nosebleed
stuff after the time skip.

00:12:58.899 --> 00:13:04.210
And so going back to this rainy night on Whole
Cake island, Sanji's insecurity and lack of

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:09.680
self-worth have pulled him to rock bottom.
His perviness is not charming anymore, but

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:15.430
annoying, his solo missions aren't successful
anymore, but a burden, he has disrespected

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:21.180
his crew and captain only to find out it was
all for nothing, and as the crowning pile

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:27.269
of s''t on top he is back with the ungrateful,
emotionless family that caused this entire

00:13:27.269 --> 00:13:33.920
mess.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:39.490
And looking at our chart, it is here that
Sanji finally has his first big revelation.

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:44.760
He understands that going off on his own was
a mistake. That there are women who would

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:50.570
exploit his chivalry. That he disrespected
Luffy. And that his desire to save people

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:54.650
on his own is a burden on those he cares for.

00:13:54.650 --> 00:14:00.180
But maybe the most heartbreaking thing is
that he finally understands that Luffy and

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:07.320
the others came to save HIM. That he was not
dispensable. That they cared so much for him,

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:13.270
that they would declare war on a Yonko. Sanji
cares so so&nbsp;much about the people he’s

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:18.760
close to, both the strawhats and zeff, but
it doesn’t seem to occur to him that they

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:25.230
care about him just as much. What really broke
my heart is that he’s genuinely surprised

00:14:25.230 --> 00:14:30.780
when luffy bombs into whole cake island to
rescue him even though literally anyone could

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:35.930
have predicted that in a heartbeat. I mean
Sanji&nbsp;has witnessed&nbsp;luffy go through hell

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:42.050
and back for nami, robin, vivi, and ace, for
ace actually multiple times I guess, and still

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:47.140
doesn’t expect that he's worth that same
level of concern. Until that moment. Where

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:59.639
he sees Luffy, starving and beaten waiting
at the very spot he promised he would wait.

00:14:59.639 --> 00:15:05.480
Whole Cake Island was Sanji's arc, because
he finally realizes his flaws. Just as Luffy

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:12.410
did with Robin, Nami and Usopp, he makes Sanji
shout out his true feelings to him and liberates

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:26.700
him from his emotional prison.[] 
Luffy and the others love him for who he is,

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:32.370
and so Sanji saves the day in Whole Cake Island
by being the kind person he is, winning over

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:37.930
Pudding's heart, saving his family and even
baking the cake to stop big moms rage and

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:40.260
save all of his enemies. [Sanji's mother:
the kindest person]

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:45.601
And this phase of growth has carried over
to Wano. Spoiler Alert from here on out. One

00:15:45.601 --> 00:15:50.410
of my favorite moments during the raid so
far has been Sanji calling Robin for help

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:57.410
when captured by Black Maria. trusting Robin
to fight Black Maria means, he now thinks

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:03.320
of Robin as a strong and reliable person instead
of a damsel in distress that needs to be saved

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:08.779
and kept out of danger. he swallowed his pride
and asked a woman to save him, even though

00:16:08.779 --> 00:16:13.889
he always has been the one saving women through
the series. And I realized that this scene

00:16:13.889 --> 00:16:19.519
stands in direct contrast to his stand-off
with Kalifa on enies lobby, where he refused

00:16:19.519 --> 00:16:26.480
to trust in Nami. I mean just look how grateful
Robin is for this gesture. She's beaming.

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:27.760
And Marco gets it too.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:32.880
So, now Sanji is getting his long-awaited
fight with Queen. However, the issue of self-worth

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:37.590
still remains. While he has overcome the trauma
of his upbringing in Whole cake island, he

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:42.240
still detests his family and now that his
own vin smoke abilities have awakened, he

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:47.710
feels disgusted and scared to lose his emotions.
Even though LuffY told him to his face that

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:53.139
he needs the kind Sanji, he now is wondering
whether Luffy might not prefer a heatless

00:16:53.139 --> 00:16:54.740
machine to fight for him.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:17:00.670
And so what Sanji now needs to realize, is
that his powers are already the opposite of

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:07.409
Germa. Queen said Judge wanted his kids to
have hearts of ice, but who stopped his plans?

00:17:07.409 --> 00:17:13.769
Sanji's mother Sora, who sacrificed herself
and gave Sanji a burning heart of kindness,

00:17:13.769 --> 00:17:16.929
the opposite to Judge's plans.

00:17:16.929 --> 00:17:22.569
With this panel during the wedding, many readers
only see Sanji saving his family, but i see

00:17:22.569 --> 00:17:28.229
SANJI AND his mother SAVING THEM, with Sanji's
burning heart.

00:17:28.229 --> 00:17:32.730
A really nice nod to this is actually Sanji's
lighter, that looks suspiciously like his

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:37.619
mother giving him fire. By the way, there
is actually a real world version of this lighter

00:17:37.619 --> 00:17:42.419
that was made as a special collaboration where
only about a thousand of these were made.

00:17:42.419 --> 00:17:45.690
And I really need to get my hands on one of
these.

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:52.080
The next really huge step people overlooked
in this recent chapter, is that Sanji chose

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:57.630
to destroy his raid suit, that was a power
people disliked to begin with. As it turns

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:03.500
out, Oda only meant it to be a catalyst for
Sanji's true power-up. However much more important

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:10.979
than this, with this Sanji also starts to
overcome his arguably worst trait, his perviness.

00:18:10.979 --> 00:18:24.279
Destroying the one thing, his perverted mind
always craved for.

00:18:24.279 --> 00:18:28.920
In the end, Sanji will realize that he is
actually most successful with women, when

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:34.359
he is his true kind and caring self. No matter
if it's viola or Pudding, Sanji is staring

00:18:34.359 --> 00:18:40.600
to understand that true chivalry is much closer
to the cool and caring spy-hero side of Sanji,

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:45.480
that we all fell in love with to begin with.
And in a more metaphoric sense, by destroying

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:51.240
the raid suit he literally choses not to hide
anymore, but be the crew mate luffy needs

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:57.340
by embracing who he is at heart. Which is
exactly what is gonna happen by the time Wano

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.340
is over.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:03.779
But, and I think this is very important, he
still has to atone for what he did on Whole

00:19:03.779 --> 00:19:08.710
Cake Island, especially in front of Zoro.
And speaking of Zoro, if you want a deeper

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:13.100
understanding of his character, I strongly
encourage you to watch my analysis of him

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:13.600
here.

